title: DirectionMultiStage
---
<<beat begin id:direction-multi-stage>>
<<stage define broadcast>>
<<view define reaction stage:main>>
<<backdrop background_dark stage:main>>
<<character hero stage:main at:left appearance:red>>
<<backdrop background_light stage:broadcast>>
<<character hero stage:broadcast at:right appearance:blue>>
<<camera stage:broadcast center:50,50 zoom:1>>
<<screen show broadcast via:cut>>
<<beat end wait:true>>
Narrator: broadcast screen shown #line:commands-direction-broadcast
<<screen show main via:cut wait:true>>
Narrator: main stage restored #line:commands-direction-main-return
<<camera view:reaction center:65,50 zoom:1.8 via:cut>>
<<screen split left:main right:reaction via:cut wait:true>>
